@host=http://localhost:8080
@accessToken=replace-with-access-token
@versionId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@fileId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Public user: approved versions only
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions?page=0&size=20

### Admin or mod owner: all versions, including pending and rejected
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Upload another version
POST {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ModweaveBoundary

--ModweaveBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

1.1.0
--ModweaveBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="changes"

Bug fixes
--ModweaveBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="example-1.1.0.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Example mod file
--ModweaveBoundary--

### Admin: approve a pending version
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions/{{versionId}}?status=APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: reject a pending version
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions/{{versionId}}?status=REJECTED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Download approved file
GET {{host}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}/download

### Delete version (owner or admin token required)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions/{{versionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
